### Why this is the ultimate fix:
By turning the timer into its own micro-component with a useEffect interval, it will now silently recalculate the exact minute difference in the background. If a batch sits pending while the user is staring at the screen, they will physically watch the timer tick up (e.g., from 1h 14m to 1h 15m) automatically, without ever needing to refresh the page!
